215
00:08:24,968 --> 00:08:26,956
and the pause is set to expire

216
00:08:26,956 --> 00:08:29,168
on November twenty-seventh,

217
00:08:29,168 --> 00:08:31,010
twenty twenty-six.

218
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:32,384
In other words,

219
00:08:32,384 --> 00:08:33,809
the tap is open,

220
00:08:33,809 --> 00:08:36,101
but the hand is still on it.

221
00:08:36,350 --> 00:08:39,530
Let me draw three kinds of chokepoints.

222
00:08:39,670 --> 00:08:40,835
The first is skill:

223
00:08:40,835 --> 00:08:43,522
Japan makes resist that others cannot yet

224
00:08:43,522 --> 00:08:44,570
copy.

225
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:46,830
The second is accident:

226
00:08:46,830 --> 00:08:49,183
neon ended up in Ukraine because that

227
00:08:49,183 --> 00:08:50,960
is where the steel was.

228
00:08:51,150 --> 00:08:52,738
The third is policy:

229
00:08:52,738 --> 00:08:55,386
China produces almost all the raw gallium

230
00:08:55,386 --> 00:08:57,530
and decides who gets it.

231
00:08:57,730 --> 00:08:59,790
Each one is fixed in a different

232
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:00,181
way,

233
00:09:00,181 --> 00:09:02,017
and none of them quickly.

234
00:09:02,283 --> 00:09:05,922
So what are governments doing about it?

235
00:09:11,583 --> 00:09:14,369
Can a country protect its chemicals like

236
00:09:14,369 --> 00:09:16,489
a strategic asset?

237
00:09:20,583 --> 00:09:23,033
Japan answered that question with a

238
00:09:23,033 --> 00:09:24,123
purchase.

239
00:09:24,213 --> 00:09:25,864
In twenty twenty-four,

240
00:09:25,864 --> 00:09:27,754
a government-backed fund,

241
00:09:27,754 --> 00:09:30,362
the Japan Investment Corporation,

242
00:09:30,362 --> 00:09:31,056
bought JSR,

243
00:09:31,056 --> 00:09:33,424
one of the three big resist makers,

244
00:09:33,424 --> 00:09:35,577
in a deal worth about about six

245
00:09:35,577 --> 00:09:37,613
point four billion dollars.

246
00:09:37,833 --> 00:09:40,273
JSR left the stock market.

247
00:09:40,373 --> 00:09:42,589
A private chemical company became,

248
00:09:42,589 --> 00:09:43,316
in effect,

249
00:09:43,316 --> 00:09:45,033
a national asset.

250
00:09:45,103 --> 00:09:47,846
JSR had already bought an American

251
00:09:47,846 --> 00:09:48,569
start-up,

252
00:09:48,569 --> 00:09:49,293
Inpria,

253
00:09:49,293 --> 00:09:51,537
for five hundred and fourteen million

254
00:09:51,537 --> 00:09:52,260
dollars,

255
00:09:52,260 --> 00:09:54,754
to own the next generation of EUV

256
00:09:54,754 --> 00:09:55,853
resist.

257
00:09:56,117 --> 00:09:59,046
That next generation is called metal oxide

258
00:09:59,046 --> 00:10:00,017
resist.

259
00:10:00,017 --> 00:10:02,401
Instead of plastic-like molecules,

260
00:10:02,401 --> 00:10:03,910
