261
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:04,325
which,

262
00:10:04,325 --> 00:10:05,834
according to Inpria,

263
00:10:05,834 --> 00:10:08,240
absorbs extreme ultraviolet light about

264
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:11,027
roughly five times more efficiently.

265
00:10:11,407 --> 00:10:13,292
JSR is now ramping the world's first

266
00:10:13,292 --> 00:10:15,625
large-scale factory for it,

267
00:10:15,625 --> 00:10:17,167
