268
00:10:17,327 --> 00:10:19,485
Japan is not only defending today's

269
00:10:19,485 --> 00:10:20,437
recipe.

270
00:10:20,437 --> 00:10:22,560
It is buying tomorrow's.

271
00:10:22,817 --> 00:10:25,274
And the materials are moving closer to

272
00:10:25,274 --> 00:10:26,767
the factories.

273
00:10:26,787 --> 00:10:28,460
At the request of TSMC,

274
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:30,885
JSR is building its first photoresist

275
00:10:30,885 --> 00:10:32,073
plant in Taiwan,

276
00:10:32,073 --> 00:10:34,982
expected to open as early as twenty

277
00:10:34,982 --> 00:10:36,067
twenty-eight.

278
00:10:36,167 --> 00:10:39,346
Its rivals Tokyo Ohka Kogyo and Shin-Etsu

279
00:10:39,346 --> 00:10:42,147
