280
00:10:42,237 --> 00:10:44,367
The reason is speed.

281
00:10:44,447 --> 00:10:47,673
Every new chip generation needs hundreds

282
00:10:47,673 --> 00:10:48,991
of test cycles,

283
00:10:48,991 --> 00:10:51,680
and shipping samples across the sea for

284
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:53,355
